{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_1111246127#7_2309605311","relevance":2,"reason":"The passage directly supports a Vietnam War economic consequence in 1968: Johnson signed the Revenue and Expenditure Control Act creating a temporary 10% income tax surcharge rather than cutting domestic programs. However, the document is about corporate tax history, not dedicated to assessing the Vietnam War's economic devastation in 1968.","learned":"In 1968 Johnson signed the Revenue and Expenditure Control Act, creating a temporary 10% income tax surcharge to help manage Vietnam War fiscal pressure."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"vietnam war\" \"u.s. economy\" (+ inflation deficit \"tax surcharge\" \"1968\"))","reason":"Search for documents more directly focused on the Vietnam War's impact on the U.S. economy, using key economic consequences identified so far."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"vietnam war\" \"u.s. economy\" (+ inflation deficit \"tax surcharge\" \"1968\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_26_102225832#1_208251138","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1200","rank":1,"snippet":"Japan, and in this, the Bretton Woods System was indeed successful. The collapse of the Bretton Woods System in 1971 could be traced to a number of reasons. The most important of these was the increasing trade imbalance of the U.S. economy. The Cold War between the United States and the USSR drained the U. S. Treasury, leading to deficit spending, and a surge in imports. Haven’t found the relevant content? Hire a subject expert to help you with The Causes of the Collapse of the Bretton Woods System Hire verified expert In particular, the <cover>Vietnam War became a veritable black hole of runaway spending. Furthermore, the rehabilitated economies of Europe and Japan soon made up for lost ground, and caught up to the United States’ economy. The U. S. economy, booming throughout the Fifties and Sixties, finally reached the point of deficit </cover>in the early 1970s.\" , \"start_char\": 752.000000 , \"title\": \"The Causes of the Collapse of the Bretton Woods System - PHDessay.com\" , \"url\": \"https://phdessay.com/the-causes-of-the-collapse-of-the-bretton-woods-system/\" }"}}
